# glc semantic-search index exclusions (gitignore syntax).
# Only files tracked at HEAD are indexed; .gitignore'd files are already skipped.
# Commit messages are always indexed. Edits trigger a full rebuild on `glc index`.

# Vendored / third-party code
vendor/
third_party/
external/

# Lockfiles
Cargo.lock
package-lock.json
yarn.lock
pnpm-lock.yaml
bun.lock
bun.lockb
go.sum
poetry.lock
uv.lock
Gemfile.lock
composer.lock

# Build output, generated and minified assets
dist/
build/
out/
*.min.js
*.min.css
*.map

# --- gluck repo-specific ---
# Search-evaluation artifacts. They quote the fixture queries and expected
# paths verbatim, so indexing them contaminates `glc report` measurements.
docs/reports/
tests/fixtures/
docs/**/*search-quality*
docs/**/*fixture-category-matrix*
/검색 품질 리포트 학습 가이드.md
/HANDOFF.md
